{"kind":"event","event_id":1764,"event_uid":"01M2GTDPZV9BM07SYEPR1XKX87","origin_instance_uid":"01M29GPTT4YE7ZYSCW8FVMKZ1J","type":"issue.commented","project_id":25,"project_uid":"01M2GTAA8JXZFQKK4XAVK280WG","project_name":"popmechanic-ultrapowers-run-130","issue_id":93,"issue_uid":"01M2GTABM7GMTBY5S7DZ7G1MNT","issue_short_id":"1mnt","actor":"exam:1@run-130","hlc_physical_ms":1789418462204,"hlc_counter":0,"content_hash":"07b9ed5a4178ac768bdfd2d57571ad6a7b1db9e3ca4087ebc1b71cfda3bdf49b","payload":{"comment_uid":"01M2GTDPZT92MRTEJS7SCWRV1Z","author":"exam:1@run-130","body":"examiner (run-130 task 1): approach for the exam at tests/exams/run_130/test_release_0_3_28.py.\n\nReading of the legs I am encoding:\n- Leg (a)/M1 — two assertions on json.load of each manifest: plugin.json['version'] == '0.3.28' (exact string equality, and the type is str, so a numeric 0.3.28 fails), and marketplace.json plugins[name=='ultrapowers'].version == '0.3.28'. The 'no other key changes' half of M1 is encoded the way the first Run: line reads it: the exam loads each manifest as it stood at the run's base (git show at $ULTRA_BASE, falling back to the literal base sha 690d2231 then HEAD if the env var is unset), applies only the version bump to that baseline, and asserts deep equality with the file on disk. So an added, removed or edited key anywhere else in either file is red. The global constraint (both manifests carry the same string) gets its own assertion.\n- Leg (b)/M2 — the bullet is read exactly as the Run: lines read it: the slice of CLAUDE.md from the line matching '**Versioning:**' through the next line beginning '- **' (sed's inclusive range), newlines joined to spaces. On that text: each of '0.3.28', 'a release is a fleet plan', 'merged by the', 'gh release create' present; the ordered regex 0\\.3\\.28.*today.*a release is a fleet plan.*merged by the.*gh release create matches; and re.findall(r'0\\.3\\.27[^0-9]*today') is empty (the grep -c = 0 leg). One extra assertion pins the bullet inside '## Conventions & gotchas', which is where M2 names it.\n\nAt BASE this is red only because both manifests still say 0.3.27 and the bullet still says 0.3.27 today — no import of anything that does not exist yet, no fixture.","created_at":"2026-09-14T20:41:02.202215893Z"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T20:41:02.204Z"}
